     "content": [
      {
       "text": "As reported on Slack by Marko Cundeković",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "You can create a resource using a blank node and you can retrieve that resource EXCEPT in text/html. There you get a 500 Server Error.",
       "type": "text"
      }
