  "description": "<p>As reported on Slack by Marko Cundeković</p>\n\n<p>You can create a resource using a blank node and you can retrieve that resource EXCEPT in text/html. There you get a 500 Server Error.</p>\n\n<p>Stack trace is<br/>\n{{WARN 09:20:04.177 <span class=\"error\">&#91;qtp100550728-91&#93;</span> (WildcardExceptionMapper) Unmapped exception<br/>\norg.apache.velocity.exception.VelocityException: Reference $subject.getURI() evaluated to null when attempting to render at /views/resource.vsl<span class=\"error\">&#91;line 58, column 64&#93;</span><br/>\n\tat org.apache.velocity.runtime.parser.node.ASTReference.render(ASTReference.java:443)<br/>\n\tat org.apache.velocity.runtime.parser.node.ASTBlock.render(ASTBlock.java:72)<br/>\n\tat org.apache.velocity.runtime.parser.node.ASTIfStatement.render(ASTIfStatement.java:87)<br/>\n\tat org.apache.velocity.runtime.parser.node.ASTBlock.render(ASTBlock.java:72)<br/>\n\tat org.apache.velocity.runtime.directive.Foreach.render(Foreach.java:420)<br/>\n\tat org.apache.velocity.runtime.parser.node.ASTDirective.render(ASTDirective.java:207)<br/>\n\tat org.apache.velocity.runtime.parser.node.SimpleNode.render(SimpleNode.java:342)<br/>\n\tat org.apache.velocity.Template.merge(Template.java:356)<br/>\n\tat org.apache.velocity.Template.merge(Template.java:260)<br/>\n\tat org.fcrepo.http.api.responses.StreamingBaseHtmlProvider.writeTo(StreamingBaseHtmlProvider.java:243)<br/>\n\tat org.fcrepo.http.api.responses.StreamingBaseHtmlProvider.writeTo(StreamingBaseHtmlProvider.java:95)}}</p>",
